{
  "name": "dsh-pet-jt",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "dsh-pet 的个性化增强分支（JT）：保留原插件全部桌宠能力，新增「定时提醒（自定义提示语，复用对话气泡）」与「随机出现/隐藏频率（各 1–120 分钟可调）」，可与原版 dsh-pet 同时安装、设置互不影响。",
  "icon": "assets/logo-jt.png",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "desktop-pet",
    "pet",
    "reminder",
    "floating-widget",
    "web-ui",
    "cordis",
    "react"
  ],
  "homepage": "https://github.com/jtsinlio/dsh-pet-jt#readme",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/jtsinlio/dsh-pet-jt.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/jtsinlio/dsh-pet-jt/issues"
  },
  "_comment": [
    "=============== dsh-pet-jt 包清单说明 ===============",
    "来源：fork 自 PC2005-cloud/dsh-pet 0.3.8（MIT），保留其全部桌宠能力与素材；本分支只做增强",
    "type: module —— 本包是 ESM",
    "main: lib/index.js —— 宿主半侧入口（Cordis 插件：name/inject/apply）",
    "icon —— 插件图标（Q 版 DeepSeek 小鲸鱼），DSH 会内联成 base64 data URL",
    "exports['./client'] —— 浏览器半侧入口，DSH 模块系统按它提供 /plugins/dsh-pet-jt/client.js",
    "dsh.bundle.patch —— 声明本包是 bundle，patch 文件是 cordis.patch.yml",
    "dsh.client —— 声明浏览器半侧的注入依赖和平台（web）",
    "命名隔离（与原版共存的关键）：包名 dsh-pet-jt、entry id dsh-pet-jt、HTTP 前缀 /dsh-pet-jt-7340、用户目录 ~/.dsh/dsh-pet-jt、Cordis 服务 petApiJt7340、斜杠命令 /petjt /chatjt /balancejt、插槽 id pet-jt / pet-jt-config、CSS 前缀 dsh-pet-jt-",
    "构建：npm run build（tsdown：src/client/index.ts + src/host/index.ts + src/standalone/cli.ts）",
    "peerDependencies —— 运行时由宿主（DSH）提供的模块，本包不打包它们",
    "================================================"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "bin": {
    "dsh-pet-jt-standalone": "lib/standalone.js"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "src",
    "assets/webm",
    "runtime/electron-helper",
    "assets/fonts",
    "assets/pic",
    "assets/memes",
    "assets/config.jsonc",
    "assets/logo.png",
    "assets/logo-jt.svg",
    "scripts/ensure-electron.mjs",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsdown",
    "bundle": "tsdown",
    "watch": "tsdown --watch",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "standalone": "node lib/standalone.js",
    "ensure:electron": "node scripts/ensure-electron.mjs"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.12.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@anthropic-ai/sdk": "0.135.0",
    "@electron-internal/extract-zip": "^1.0.5",
    "@electron/get": "^5.1.0",
    "openai": "7.39.0",
    "zod": "4.6.7"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.1.7-rc.2": "incompatible",
        "0.2.0-rc.1": "compatible",
        "0.2.0-rc.2": "compatible",
        "0.2.1-rc.2": "compatible"
      }
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-default-model": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-commands": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-webserver": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": "^0.2.0-rc.1",
    "react": "^18.2.0",
    "react-dom": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.10.0",
    "@types/react": "^18.3.12",
    "@types/react-dom": "^18.3.1",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.1",
    "tsdown": "^0.9.9",
    "typescript": "^5.6.3"
  }
}
